  "solution": {
    "text": "For collision between blocks <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.5</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />From principle of momentum conservation,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>mv</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>mv</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />Adding eqs. (i) and (ii), we get<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>7.5</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>iii</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />Similarly for collision between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>.5</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>.5</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.5</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.75</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> ...(iv)<br /><br />Adding Eqs. (iii) and (iv) we get<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>11.25</mtext></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>.25</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mtext>5.6</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
